  "body": "It seems that V2.8 and V2.9 are very similar and duplicate most controls, but use slightly different wording (e.g., 2.8.1 vs. 2.9.1 and 2.8.4 vs. 2.9.4):\r\n> Verify that symmetric keys used to verify submitted codes is highly protected, such as using an **HSM or OS based** key storage.\r\n\r\nvs.\r\n\r\n> Verify that symmetric keys used to verify submitted codes is highly protected, such as using an **hardware security module or secure operating system** key storage.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
